{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","菲"],["/names/en","Fay"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名驾驭宝石之力的辅助，擅长为大范围内的友军提供强化。"],["/description_i18n/en","A Support who wields an ancient gemstone that can enhance allies over a large area."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好！准备上场啦！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","All set! I'm ready for my grand entrance."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","更加闪亮了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Even shinier!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","大家，加油！打起精神来！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Come on everyone! Keep your spirits up!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","梦想……还没有实现……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","My dreams... still unrealized."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","胜利属于大家！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Victory belongs to everyone!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","准备开始辉煌的冒险吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Ready to embark on a glorious adventure?!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","颜色，火彩，棒极了，你好！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Ooh! The color and clarity are phenomenal. Oh! Eheh, hello!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","这里会不会有宝石呢？成功，太棒了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Could there be treasure here? Uhm... mmh... yeah? Yes! Amazing! ... Oh."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","怎么了，这边，不对，那边，不会坏了吧？真是的。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Oh... huh!? Ugh, now what's up? This way? No... that way! Ughh..."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇，这是您特意为我准备的吗？好荣幸！！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Wow, you prepared this specially for me?! I'm honored!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","居然能收到魔法师送的礼物……好棒！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","I can't believe I received a gift from the great Magister... How awesome!"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","绚彩光舞"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Colorful Dancer"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","去探寻比宝石更灿烂的未来吧！"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Go explore the future that is brighter than the brightest gem!"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","绚光星辰"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Radiant Stars"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","魔法是世界上最绚烂的表演！"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","Magic is the most wonderful power in the world!"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","启程之礼累计登录4天后可领取该皮肤。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Journey's Gift - Log in for 4 days"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Elite"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","咦？这里有宝石！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Eh? There are gems here!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","下次考试能通过吗……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Will I be able to pass my next test...?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","水果芭菲！最大杯！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Fruit parfait! Gimme the largest cup!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啊！星星灯！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Ah! Starry lights!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节快乐呀！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Happy Winter Carnival!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好漂亮的灯和彩缎！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Such beautiful lights and satin ribbons!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","快去放烟花吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's go light some fireworks!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","菲曾经在十块普通石头里准确无误地选中藏有翡翠的一块。虽然但那块翡翠的尺寸小到完全可以忽略不计的程度……"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Fay once accurately picked the rock that contained jade from ten seemingly ordinary ones, even though the jade's size was negligible."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","“菲那孩子什么时候才能意识到，她是天生的大明星，魔法和研究真的不适合她。”某位知名的演员经纪人和魔法学院的学员导师都做出过类似的评价。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","\"When will Fay realize she was born to be a star? Magic and research work aren't for her!\" — a consensus among all students and teachers at the magic academy."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","魔法学院的预科班曾经举行过一次短跑比赛：比赛学生们的加速魔法水平。菲是唯一一个没能用出这个基础法术的学员，但她凭借身体素质获得了第一。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","During a race testing students' mastery of the acceleration spell, Fay was the only one who failed to use it but still won first place due to her strong fitness."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","冬青学会传说，菲曾经在探险时不小心掉进陷坑里，结果砸出了一条密道——通向一个隐秘的藏宝洞，最终整个队伍满载而归。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Once, Fay fell into a trap while exploring, only to discover a secret path leading to a cavern full of treasure. Everyone returned fully loaded with relics and antiques from that expedition."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","菲喜欢热热闹闹的环境，一旦没人说话就会浑身不自在——或许这就是她没法在图书馆待下去的原因。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Fay enjoys bustling settings and feels uncomfortable with no one to talk to. Perhaps this is why she never stays in the library."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据说菲有一次被盗匪绑架，在被救出来的时候，她已经和隔壁笼子被绑的另一位倒霉蛋聊到了未来的职业规划。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Fay got kidnapped by bandits once. When her rescuers came to save her, they found that she and another unfortunate soul who was also kidnapped were casually chatting about their future career plans in their respective cages."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","菲能在一大把人工伪造的宝石中准确地挑出一颗真品，但在魔法学院的入学考试时，却总能完美地避开四个选项里唯一的正确选项。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","While Fay can effortlessly spot the real gem among fakes, she managed to miss all the correct answers to the multiple-choice questions in the Lyceum's entrance exam."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","据说菲只要坐上一辆公共马车，下车之前，她就能认识包括车夫在内的所有人。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","People say that if Fay takes a ride in a public carriage, she'll strike up conversations with everyone, passengers and drivers alike, before she hops off."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","如果对菲说“你没有魔法天赋，放弃吧”，她只会笑嘻嘻地继续坚持；但如果说“魔法根本没有意义！”她却会立刻火冒三丈。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","If you tell Fay that she has no talent for magic, she'll just smile politely and move on. But if you call magic a meaningless pursuit, she'll fly into a rage immediately."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","菲从来没有祈祷或许过“让我进入魔法学院”之类的愿望，因为她认为那要靠自己努力。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Fay never tried to pray or wish her way into the Serene Lyceum because she knows that only effort will get her accepted into that magical school. \"I love Dura, but she's not going to help me get into the Lyceum. Only I can.\""],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","毛皮……矿石……零件……编织物……唔唔唔唔……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Fur... minerals... spare parts... braids... Hmm..."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415015.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415015.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Marilee & Fay"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","咦？这里有宝石！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Eh? There are gems here!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415068.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415068.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Fay"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","水果芭菲！最大杯！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Fruit parfait! Gimme the largest cup!"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415069.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415069.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Fay"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","啊！星星灯！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Ah! Starry lights!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415373.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415373.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Fay"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节快乐呀！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Happy Winter Carnival!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415374.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415374.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Fay"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","好漂亮的灯和彩缎！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Such beautiful lights and satin ribbons!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415543.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415543.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Fay"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","快去放烟花吧！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Let's go light some fireworks!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415544.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415544.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Fay"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","那——么，在闪耀的红宝石之下，打起精神来吧！"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Under the ruby's shining hue, kindle the fervor, spirits renew!"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414030.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414030.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 维伦 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Fay & Valen & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","准备扎营休息了吗？早知道就给家里捎个信了……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Are we camping? I should have notified my family..."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414040.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414040.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Marilee & Fay"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","漫漫，有喜欢的宝石吗？喜欢哪颗就拿走吧。"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Hammie, do you have a favorite gem? Take whichever you like."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414090.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414090.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Fay & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","我啊，一直都想有些弟弟妹妹……"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","I always wanted to have some younger siblings..."],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414110.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414110.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Fay & Marilee"],["/interaction_records/10/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/10/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Remnant Peaks"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","特弥希娅，你在喝燕麦粥吗？"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","Temesia, are you having oatmeal?"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414120.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414120.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 特弥希娅"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Fay & Temesia"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","寻宝需要的是智慧、灵巧和运气，三者缺一不可……"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/en","Treasure hunting requires wisdom, agility, and luck. All three are indispensable."],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414160.json"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414160.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/en","Atalanta & Fay"]]}